# k.kinds/shards/feature-wordnet: 37 up edges: what a thing has, read off the WordNet parts of k.parts: a thing with wheels, a machine (it has an engine or a motor), a thing with wings.
# sources: wordnet 3.1 (Princeton WordNet 3.1, read from k.words and k.parts as imported)
